Automated Blot Quantification - License and Usage Notice
============================================================

Copyright (c) Alexandre Matov. All rights reserved except as granted below.

1. Scope
--------
This repository contains a Java ImageJ plugin and a Unity C# function
developed by Alexandre Matov for automated quantification of western
blots by area segmentation. The code depends on third-party
software/plugins that are NOT included in this repository -- see
DEPENDENCIES.md.

