In no event shall the author be liable for any claim, damages, or other
liability arising from the use of this software.

4. Third-party components
--------------------------
`JBlots.java` depends on the ImageJ plugin API, which is not bundled in
this repository. `WesternBlotSegmentationAnalysis.cs` depends on Unity
and OpenCV for Unity -- requires a separate paid license from Enox
Software. See DEPENDENCIES.md.
